 ## Background
-DARBF-Splatting was introduced by Hashiru Pramuditha, Vinasirajan Viruthshaan, Vishagar Arunan, Saeedha Nazar, Sameera Ramasinghe, Simon Lucey, and Ranga Rodrigo from the University of Moratuwa and University of Adelaide [S1]. It was published in 2026 in the IEEE Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision (WACV) [S1]. The work generalizes splatting techniques beyond the exponential family, addressing the underexplored area of non-Gaussian reconstruction kernels in 3D Gaussian Splatting [S1].
